<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DST Systems downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DST Systems downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded DST Systems Inc to &quot;outperform speculative&quot; from &quot;outperform long-term.&quot;</p>
<p>-- cited potentially adverse interest rate and monetary environment.</p>
<p>-- said the company's underlying network mutual fund servicing business looks hopeful.</p>
<p>-- DST gained 1/4 to 27-5/8.</p>
</text>
